  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For the given GP, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><mo> </mo><mo>;</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>where</mtext><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mtext>Sum of odd terms</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ar</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>63</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>62</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>64</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>64</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>64</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>64</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
